      "note": [
        "Almost all government subsidies for construction ended from 01-01-2007 onwards. This meant that a large amount of constructions was started at the end of 2006, affecting the number of dwellings started in 2007. This also means that the total figures for conversion starts after 2006 and for completed conversions after 2007 is not possible to present."
